{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S01、S05 等短停留段落里长句偏难扫完，不如 X 的放大关键词醒目，也损失了一些跟随音乐逐步出现的细微感受。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的高亮短句更容易让人迅速抓住每段要点，但大量相近的感受词会分散注意力，实际留下的细节未必更多。Y 把对方的反应、他的猜测和每次情绪转变的原因交代得更清楚，前后十四段能连成一条不断发展的心理线。Y 的感受词虽然更少，但多数保留了具体的身体感觉和甜蜜中夹着不安的层次，因此整体更容易看懂，也更容易真正感受到这个人。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "23f768de-ae38-4cc9-9edc-cc0bc858fc17", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060223109857Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:03:39.942613+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cc36bb95923f85d486e05ef8a4cacd1646de6ab1655b297c9b3949411be40782", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.